RepeatABEL v1.1 (Release date: 2016-08-17)
==============

Changes:

    * Update to version 1.1
    * Citation updated
    * Vignette bug for heritability estimate updated

RepeatABEL v2 (Release date: 2025-12-07)
==============

Changes:

* The package is no longer dependent on GenABEL
* Generic plot and summary functions added. These are slimmed version of the ones in GenABEL
* The classes gwaa.data2 and scan.gwaa2 were added. These are simplified versions of the gwaa.data and scan.gwaa classes in GenABEL
  
